Package: akashic.civics
Title: Akashic Civics R Package
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Akashic Civics Project
Maintainer: Akashic Civics Project <elijah@example.com>
Description: R package for criminal justice disparity analysis. Provides statistical methods for disparate impact analysis, sentencing disparity, trend monitoring, and causal inference. Includes doubly-robust estimation, OLS/logistic regression, adaptive disconfirmation testing, and multi-jurisdiction comparison.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyLoad: yes
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils,
    jsonlite,
    MASS
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    sandwich,
    lmtest
URL: https://github.com/elijah/akashic-civics
BugReports: https://github.com/elijah/akashic-civics/issues